@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Admin" as User
participant "AdminPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "AccountController" as Controller
participant "AccountService" as Service
participant "AppUserRepository" as Repo
participant "VerificationEmailService" as Email
database "Database" as DB

== UC-10: Restrict or Restore Customer Booking Ability ==

User -> UI : 1. Enter reason and confirm restriction
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. updateCustomerRestriction(customer, restricted, reason)
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. PUT /api/account/users/{userId}/restriction
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. updateRestriction(userId, request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. requireAdmin(); Customer role; reason required
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. findById(userId)
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT/UPDATE app_user booking_restricted
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Customer AppUser
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Set restriction; revoke tokens
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
  Service -> DB : 12. INSERT restriction/restoration notification
  activate DB
  DB --> Service : 13. Notification stored
  deactivate DB
  Service -> Email : 14. Send restriction/restoration email
  activate Email
  Email --> Service : 15. Delivery status
  deactivate Email
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Non-customer or blank reason -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 16. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 17. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 18. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 19. refreshAll()
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 20. Show access and delivery status
deactivate App

UI --> User : 21. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
